# Fiber Framework

## Description

Fiber is an Express-inspired web framework built on top of Fasthttp, the fastest HTTP engine for Go. Provides zero memory allocation and high performance.

## When to Use

- Building REST APIs with Go
- High-performance web applications
- Applications requiring Express-like API
- Real-time applications

